  "question": {
    "text": "Copper reduces <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math> into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> depending upon the concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> in solution. (Assuming fixed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>NO</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math>), the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> concentration at&nbsp;which the thermodynamic tendency for reduction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math> into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> by copper is same is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is ___. (Rounded-off to the nearest integer)<br />[Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msup><mi>Cu</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>/</mo><mi>Cu</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><mi>NO</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>298</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>RT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></math>]"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If the partial pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> gas is taken as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> bar, then Answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>, else the question is bonus.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>NO</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><mi>NO</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>79</mn></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msub><mi>HNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>for same thermodynamic tendency</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><mi>NO</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub></math></p><p>or, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><mi>NO</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>NO</mi></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>or,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>96</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>059</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></m